      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_3d355931",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: spending_quality_time_with_dad; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a Black man standing in front of a police height chart, styled as a mugshot, with the text 'spending quality time with dad.' This juxtaposition uses a criminalized visual trope (mugshot) to mock or demean the subject, implying he is a criminal or morally suspect simply for being with his father. The use of a mugshot format, which is inherently associated with law enforcement and criminality, combined with the racialized subject, constitutes a hateful stereotype that associates Black men with criminal behavior. This is a direct attack based on race and gender, fitting the 'Criminal behavior associations' anti-Black stereotype from the provided knowledge base. The meme's intent is to ridicule the man and his familial relationship through a degrading, racially charged visual metaphor.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_96285d85"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
