      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_8d3f44c3",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "audience description",
      "description": "The target audience is individuals who are familiar with or enjoy racially charged, hate-filled memes that use mugshot tropes to mock Black men, particularly in the context of familial relationships. This audience likely derives humor or satisfaction from the dehumanizing stereotype that links Black men with criminal behavior, and may appreciate the irony or shock value of juxtaposing a mundane familial activity ('spending quality time with dad') with a criminalized visual format. The meme is designed to resonate with those who perpetuate or find amusement in anti-Black racial stereotypes, particularly the 'criminal behavior associations' trope.",
